label story_04_complete (Echoes Beneath the Stones Complete)
[style name="Gameplay"]
"Dianthus Core" (Default): Shadow Resin stains your hands. But your hands still know how to shape, how to mend, how to make something useful from what the dark discards.
"Dianthus Core": The Phantom Weavers were guarding more than rubble. Beneath Veld, the Void was weaving a door — thread by thread, night by night, while we fought its lesser mouths above.
"Dianthus Core": A recipe is stirring in my oldest roots. It is dangerous. But danger guided by careful hands can defend life as fiercely as any wall.
"Dianthus Core": Craft for what comes next, little alchemist. Something with a greater will moves behind the lesser shadows. I can feel it pressing its weight against the seal.
